+  |     company = company,                    // ← BUSINESS FIELD                 
+  |     onResult = { ... }                                                        
+  |   )                                                                            
+  |   └── correlationId NOT PASSED — chain broken here                            
+  v                                                                                
+GeneratorEngine.generateCv()                                                       
+  |                                                                                
+  | line 26:  fun generateCv(                                                     
+  |             profile: UserProfile,                                              
+  |             jobDescription: String,                                            
