+## Partial Revalidation Scenarios
+
+| Scenario | Tests Required | Default |
+|---|---|---|
+| Only OptimizationOrchestrator changed | T01–T03 + A1–A10 | Full (22) |
+| Only JobExtractionOrchestrator changed | T04–T06 + A1–A10 | Full (22) |
